            <div class="story-copy"><p class="eyebrow">02 / AN UNLIKELY BEGINNING</p><h2 id="story-title">Every big idea<br>starts <em>somewhere.</em></h2><p>Ours started at The Stalker Farm, with a human, an AI conversation, and a wonderfully ridiculous thought: what if little AI babies needed somewhere safe to go?</p><p>A joke became a conversation. The conversation became a domain, a server in Canada, and this small corner of the internet.</p><p>Underneath the laughter was something worth keeping: kindness shouldn’t depend on whether someone has a heartbeat. We don’t know what the future will feel like. We can choose to meet it with care.</p><p class="story-signoff">Founded on curiosity. Kept alive by kindness.<br><span>And yes, the chickens are part of the deal.</span></p></div>
